{"title":"The Unmoved","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 52 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>90</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>114</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>85</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>188</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>178</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>52</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>90</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>114</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=56\" title=\"Pick level 56\"><td><b>56</b></td><td>389</td><td>35.3</td><td>2,800</td><td class=\"muted\">1,167 · 49.4 · 8,400</td><td>85</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>188</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>178</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>5</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 93 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 103 recorded drops, 15,917 total, 19–248 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d